5. Created a bound version of the translate function using useCallback
6. Made sure the translate function is properly passed through the attendee's language object
7. Added more comprehensive translations that might be needed by the base email component
8. Ensured the translate function has a proper name property
9. Improved the variable replacement logic in the translate function

The key changes that should fix the "t is not a function" error are:
