2. Ensuring the translate function has all the necessary properties
3. Passing the translate function correctly through the attendee's language object
4. Making sure the function maintains its identity between renders

This should resolve the error by ensuring that a proper, bound translation function is always available to both the NoShowFeeChargedEmail component and its child components.

